                <pb facs="0454" n="445" xml:id="pg445"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2531/280: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Frost</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-03-29T18:00:00-04:00">March 29, 1938—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received March 29—5:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>38. Referring to my telegram No. 36, March 24, 4 p.m. and to the Department’s 26,
                    March 29, 11 a.m. Treaty Commission approved exchange proposal at meeting on
                    March 25 and expects to reach decision on the general provisions <hi
                        rendition="#italic">en bloc</hi> at meeting on April 1.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Frost</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
